1
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,920
kicking a pebble, flying on a cloud.

3
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:29,340
to the pillar of the joking type,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,800
they laughed that I stayed so cheerful.

5
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:37,440
Even if I drop my energy somewhere,

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,680
for real, it's solid as stone.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,020
One nightmare, unchanged.

8
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,880
The streets are even gentler.

9
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,860
Because the crows are cawing.

10
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,600
Ponzu sauce gave me

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,940
yakitori, Honbari.

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,880
Are you there?

13
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:57,520
Of the pointed hat,

14
00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:02,420
from Sosui to Daishaku-den,

15
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:04,060
the sunset falls.

16
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:10,080
Tomorrow too, I'll drop it and
that'll be the end, won't it.

17
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,720
Katsushika, Shibamata,
happiness again, they say.

18
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,660
Taking it easy, I realized.

19
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,300
Because I'm such a fool.

20
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:17,600
Yeah

21
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:27,260
Intense Battle Shogi

22
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:31,020
Ote!

23
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:33,200
Hey, wait a minute!

24
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:36,400
Want a take-back? Go ahead, don't hold back.

25
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,160
Good.

26
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,400
But,

27
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:42,360
each take-back costs 3,000 yen.

28
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:45,240
I'm not paying that kind of money!

29
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:47,360
Then I win

30
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:52,240
I've played Kei-chan three
times and won all three.

31
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:55,180
Ryo-chan, your shogi skills
are pretty impressive, you know.

32
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:57,940
I'm confident in chess, though.

33
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:02,480
I could even play you with
a bishop handicap if you like.

34
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,760
It'll cost you 5,000 yen per match,
mind you.

35
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,560
No thanks. I'll pass.

36
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,320
Well, how about you two?

37
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,380
I'll pass too.

38
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:11,700
Pass for me too.

39
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:17,680
Not to brag, but I've never
lost at shogi since I was a kid.

40
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:20,140
But there's always someone better than you.

41
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:25,140
Chief Ohara won the headquarters shogi tournament,
so he's really that good.

42
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:28,340
That's right.
The Chief's shogi is the real deal.

43
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:31,400
Hah, when it's me,
it's a piece of cake, a piece of cake.

44
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,960
Quite the confidence you have.

45
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:36,100
Of course.
In shogi, inspiration is everything.

46
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:39,020
Like the Chief,
with his stubborn, rigid head...

47
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,640
Aaah, Chief!

48
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:44,773
I'd like to say playing shogi on
duty is out of the question, but

49
00:02:44,823 --> 00:02:48,440
since you're pushing me this far,
I'll play one game with you.

50
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,200
You're really going to
play the senior officer?

51
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:53,140
Wow, this is a match worth watching.

52
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:56,480
Just playing for nothing
wouldn't be any fun.

53
00:02:56,660 --> 00:03:00,760
If I win,
you're buying my lunch for the next month.

54
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,300
Fine.

55
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,760
Alright, I won't hold back.

56
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,560
Here I come.

57
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:12,480
Come at me whenever you're ready.

58
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:24,020
The Chief's expression changed.

59
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:29,060
What an intense aura.

60
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,540
The Chief is serious about this.

61
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:53,620
There's no escape.

62
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:55,260
That settles the match, then.

63
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:56,740
As expected of the Chief.

64
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:57,780
Damn it!

65
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:01,860
You lost, you know.

66
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:07,640
You're not yet good enough
to give me any real trouble.

67
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,900
Chief, one more round!

68
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:11,120
No matter how many times we play,
it'll be the same.

69
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:14,460
Here we go again, Ryo-san.

70
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:15,400
One more time.

71
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,360
Senpai, that's...

72
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,640
One more time.

73
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,460
Ryo-chan.

74
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:19,600
One more round!

75
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,760
One more time.

76
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,940
One more time.

77
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,080
One more time.

78
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,200
Why don't you just quit already?

79
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,480
Damn it!

80
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,580
No matter how many times I try,
I can't beat that Chief.

81
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,480
Today we're drinking until
we're completely wiped out.

82
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,580
Your move.

83
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:38,320
Wait, hold on a second!

84
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,640
Take-back, come on, wait for me!

85
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:43,420
A take-back costs 500 yen a time.

86
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:46,300
From the third one on, it doubles.
Is that okay?

87
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,920
N-no way!

88
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:50,260
Damn it, better than losing.

89
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:53,760
What are you doing, old man?

90
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,700
Anyone can see that, you fool.

91
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,180
Does this look like karuta to you?

92
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:00,300
Your move.

93
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:03,660
Don't you dare talk to me, you jerk!

94
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,100
Calm down, old man!

95
00:05:05,380 --> 00:05:07,600
What's this, isn't that Kankitsu?

96
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,611
Don't "what" me.

97
00:05:09,661 --> 00:05:12,820
Dad lost to someone at shogi. Who is he?

98
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,260
Like I'd know his name.

99
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:18,300
Asked for my name? It would be
too presumptuous of me to state it.

100
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:24,560
Enough to silence crying children, you call
this Grand Shogi's Ōte Hisha-Kaku opening?

101
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,380
About the thanks for this.

102
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:27,780
Deeee!

103
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,920
The kid who was quiet has started crying,
damn it!

104
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:34,580
Ohh, there, there... peekaboo!

105
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,800
The gap here is huge, you know.

106
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:40,080
But, you know, his skill is the real deal.

107
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,720
So he's the Grand Shogi king

108
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:48,560
Hahaha! You're so carefree and sloppy in
character that your shogi is sloppy too!

109
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:51,060
After all, your shogi is just self-taught.

110
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:53,280
If you're bitter about it,
learn the fundamentals!

111
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:56,440
Like this defeat,
come closer to me one step at a time!

112
00:05:59,980 --> 00:06:01,560
Now then, as a special service,

113
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:04,400
I'll show you my treasured secret technique.

114
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:08,360
Secret technique: Vacuum Tornado Drop!

115
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,800
Dance of the Dragon God.

116
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,760
Wow, that's incredible.

117
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,720
This might be the real deal.

118
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,040
Please, I beg you.

119
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:30,500
Take me on as your disciple!
I've got to beat the Chief no matter what!

120
00:06:30,980 --> 00:06:31,840
Fool!

121
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:33,882
The heart of shogi is the heart of defeat.

122
00:06:33,932 --> 00:06:36,534
Defeat is defeat;
it leads straight to losing.

123
00:06:36,584 --> 00:06:40,720
The mind that keeps wanting to
win gives rise to wicked thoughts.

124
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,660
W-what!?

125
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:47,281
Understand that shogi begins
with defeat and ends with defeat.

126
00:06:47,331 --> 00:06:50,320
No matter how strong someone is,
they will eventually lose.

127
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:54,762
Master, I'm asking you again.

128
00:06:54,812 --> 00:06:56,800
Please make me your disciple!

129
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,240
Please, Master.

130
00:07:01,340 --> 00:07:04,040
You want to become my disciple that badly?

131
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,540
Yes.

132
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:06,660
Then, first,

133
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:07,240
Yes.

134
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,860
Sente first.

135
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:12,800
Fuukeebaa.

136
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:16,980
Fuukeebaa.

137
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:17,840
Fuukeebaa.

138
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,500
Fuukeebaa.

139
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:19,620
Fuukeebaa.

140
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:23,000
I didn't think anyone still
uses a bath like this these days.

141
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,320
Master.

142
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,860
How's the water temperature?

143
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:45,800
Ahaha, looks like I'm finally
going to get real shogi lessons!

144
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,200
I'm in your care!

145
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:54,800
Yes, sir!
Next up is piecework, pasting bags.

146
00:07:56,080 --> 00:08:03,620
What's this? Heating the bath, cleaning the toilets, bag-pasting piecework?
I came here to train in shogi!

147
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:04,820
Got a complaint?

148
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:08,020
But you keep making me do things
that have nothing to do with shogi!

149
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:08,820
You fool!

150
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,920
You inexperienced fool!

151
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:14,740
Techniques you haven't seen?
There's no such thing.

152
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:18,820
I was trying to teach
you the spirit of shogi.

153
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:20,660
The spirit of shogi.

154
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:25,100
As I said earlier,
the heart of shogi is the heart of defeat.

155
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:27,300
It begins in defeat and ends in defeat.

156
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:30,240
Let's think about everything
you've done so far.

157
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:32,080
What I've done?

158
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:38,080
First it was stoking the bath,
then summoned to clean the toilets.

159
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,760
And last, bag-folding.

160
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:43,660
In other words,
suffering begins and ends with suffering.

161
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:46,880
I-I get it! Don't make a fool of me!

162
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,160
Got a complaint?

163
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:49,560
Of course I do!

164
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:52,900
If you're not going to teach me shogi,
I'm going home.

165
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:57,080
If you're going to insist that much,
I'll teach you.

166
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,300
Now that's some serious intensity.

167
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:15,420
Impossible! This Hagakure Technique,

168
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:21,180
whoa, I can see a lot of sesame seeds!

169
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:24,420
Nice! The Heavenly Lightning Drop!

170
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:36,960
Magnificent.

171
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:42,400
You are the successor to Battle Shogi that
I have been waiting for all these years.

172
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:45,340
What's Battle Shogi?

173
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:46,940
Look at this.

174
00:09:46,940 --> 00:09:52,340
Battle Shogi is a new game that fuses
traditional shogi with martial arts.

175
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,600
The rules are very simple.

176
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,540
The pieces are made of iron,

177
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:59,800
and you win by taking your opponent's
king by any means necessary.

178
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:05,600
The loser's cushion has explosives rigged to it,
and when electricity runs through, it blows up.

179
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:09,580
With your intellect,
you could never win at traditional shogi,

180
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:14,240
but with this Battle Shogi,
becoming world champion isn't just a dream.

181
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,060
World champion?

182
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,260
My eye for talent is never wrong.

183
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:22,380
You were born to play Battle Shogi.

184
00:10:22,380 --> 00:10:26,260
Win this world tournament
and the prize money is huge.

185
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:27,940
You'll be in demand for commercials too.

186
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:31,060
In the future,
it should even become an Olympic event.

187
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:31,960
If that happens,

188
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,440
maybe I could live a luxurious life too.

189
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,360
Master!

190
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,940
Please teach me!

191
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:38,700
That Battle Shogi of yours...

192
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:40,600
Training will be harsh.

193
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,360
I won't complain again.

194
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:44,460
Well said!

195
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:47,640
Let's aim for the Battle
Shogi King title together!

196
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,200
Master!

197
00:10:51,140 --> 00:10:51,540
This is...

198
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:53,080
N-no way...

199
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:54,180
Indeed.

200
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:57,440
Battle Shogi, devised by... Gibbs?

201
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:17,800
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu

202
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,680
Ugh...

203
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:23,960
Ugh...

204
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,640
No way!

205
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,140
The match is decided!

206
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:10,620
Red Dynamite Nagasaki wins.

207
00:12:13,380 --> 00:12:16,420
It's more like mixed martial arts than shogi,
isn't it?

208
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:18,700
This is perfect for Ryo-chan!

209
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,900
Is there really such a
thing as this kind of shogi?

210
00:12:20,900 --> 00:12:22,940
Next up is Ryo-san!

211
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,960
Now entering the ring: Strong Kondo!

212
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,400
From the blue corner,

213
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:43,800
Now entering the ring: Kankichi Ryotsu!

214
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:50,220
Ryo-chan, hang in there!

215
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:52,760
Ryo-san, you're definitely
going to win the tournament!

216
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:58,760
Mm.

217
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:08,120
Kacchi, don't you dare lose! Listen, if you use the
technique the Chief taught you, you're sure to win.

218
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:15,760
No time limit, one match.
Both fighters ready... Begin!

219
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,500
Me

220
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,000
Boo, boo!

221
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:35,180
Here I come! Today's the day!

222
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:38,460
That's an amazing technique, senior!

223
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:45,120
Ansee, that one! Use that one!

224
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:50,160
Tenkū! Unleash the lightning!

225
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:09,900
Okay!

226
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,500
The match is over!

227
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:13,640
Blue, Ryotsu Base wins!

228
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:17,240
Wow!

229
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:18,820
Ryo-san won!

230
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,780
Go for it, Kankichi!

231
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,840
What an idiot!

232
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:32,540
Round two. Red, Ryuo Watanabe Squad.
Blue, Ryotsu Kankichi.

233
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,660
Say my name!

234
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,540
Ryo-san's in trouble!

235
00:14:48,540 --> 00:14:53,040
The match is decided.
In shogi skill, he's far above Ryotsu.

236
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,780
Don't hesitate, Kankichi!
There's only one option here!

237
00:14:56,780 --> 00:14:59,960
Eek! Big eruption jab, big big!

238
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:12,300
He's rearranging the pieces to suit himself.

239
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:14,040
What a sneaky move!

240
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:16,720
It's perfectly legal
under Battle Shogi rules.

241
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:20,620
The match restarts from the
beginning with the pieces set up again.

242
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:31,240
Match over! Blue Ryosuke Base wins!

243
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,360
Incredible! A one-shot total reversal!

244
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:46,900
Semifinal round: Red Ryosuke Base
versus Blue Dynamite Nagasaki!

245
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,940
Here I go! Deadly human!

246
00:15:50,780 --> 00:15:51,780
What!?

247
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:02,020
Ryo-san, hurry, hurry!

248
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:11,460
With this, he can't use the
Great Eruption Jam Reversal!

249
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,680
Cat-Feint Mid-Air Great Spin!

250
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:17,080
Yes.

251
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:20,120
What, what did you say!

252
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,480
Ready... go!

253
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:23,740
Go for it, Ryo-san!

254
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:25,820
Go on!

255
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,540
Ready... go!

256
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,020
Ready... go!

257
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,000
Okay!

258
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:37,745
The ones who made it to the final of
the Battle Shogi World Championship are

259
00:16:37,795 --> 00:16:39,100
these two!

260
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:43,800
Kameari's caveman, Ryotsu Kankichi!

261
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:47,700
You're the world champion! Ryo-san!

262
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,160
Ryo-chan, you're amazing!

263
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:51,200
Stand by! Do your best!

264
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:53,340
Just do whatever you want already.

265
00:16:53,340 --> 00:16:56,260
Kankichi! Win no matter what it takes!

266
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,660
This day has finally come.

267
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:01,340
The opponent is that longtime rival.

268
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:04,220
And that opponent is...

269
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,740
Manjō's Leonid Meteor Storm!

270
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:08,560
Shooting Star Ittetsu!

271
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,660
Kankichi!

272
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,540
Don't let your guard down.

273
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:20,700
He's the man who drove me into retirement.

274
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:21,500
Master.

275
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:26,460
Master.

276
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,340
Firing angle.

277
00:17:38,340 --> 00:17:40,300
You or me.

278
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:44,780
The loser of this match must
gracefully retire from Battle Shogi.

279
00:17:46,020 --> 00:17:47,940
Bring it on, Ichitetsu.

280
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:54,160
You're already sunk.

281
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:54,800
What?

282
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,360
Exactly.

283
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:08,280
In that match, I lost to
Ichitetsu's Heavenly Lightning Drop.

284
00:18:27,100 --> 00:18:30,840
That Ittetsu and Manadesh, the citrus,
should meet face to face here now.

285
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:33,020
This is truly a bitter, fateful bond.

286
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:36,440
Master, I will avenge my master's enemy!

287
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:39,220
Go and do your best.

288
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,780
This is the stage for the final match.

289
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:56,700
It will be held in a special
ring built on the Sumida River.

290
00:18:57,540 --> 00:19:00,840
The shogi pieces used in
the final weigh 100 kilos.

291
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:04,560
In this battle on the river,
with nowhere to run and no one to help,

292
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:08,840
it is truly the battle of Musashi
and Kojiro on Ganryu Island.

293
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:09,560
Certain victory.

294
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:10,740
Ryo-chan!

295
00:19:10,740 --> 00:19:11,760
Ryo-san!

296
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:14,980
Will it be Ryo or Musashi who wins?

297
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,700
Or Shooting Star Kojiro?

298
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,860
Kankichi, go all out!

299
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:27,400
The shogi board is the ring, after all.

300
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:32,640
Neither the Neko-dama Four-Air Great Rotation
nor the Great Eruption Chabu Return can be used.

301
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:39,240
Your position is already lost.

302
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:43,700
It's over! The Shooting Star Ittetsu's
signature line already came out.

303
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:47,520
Begin!

304
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:59,200
The action is heating up already!

305
00:19:59,580 --> 00:20:01,320
We can't take our eyes off this!

306
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:08,180
Whoa! Shooting Star Flash!

307
00:20:08,260 --> 00:20:10,080
Ryotsu scored a point!

308
00:20:11,380 --> 00:20:13,660
Damn, this is really brutal.

309
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,220
Looks like the senior's
stamina is draining fast.

310
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:23,640
Take this, Heavenly Knee Drop!

311
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:27,140
Giant Whirlpool Version

312
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:32,740
W-what is this?

313
00:20:33,220 --> 00:20:36,720
Ittetsu's spin has created a giant tornado!

314
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:40,640
Ittetsu has perfected that great technique!

315
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:53,660
Look! Kankichi, that's a dummy!

316
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:05,000
It's Ryo-san!

317
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,340
Ryo-chan!

318
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:17,500
Th-this is a devastating blow!
Can you get up, Ryotsu Kankichi!

319
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:23,800
Get up, stand up, Kankichi!
Rise and grab your glory, Kankichi!

320
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:30,040
You're everything to me.
I need you, I need you, you know.

321
00:21:33,980 --> 00:21:35,960
Don't worry.

322
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:40,280
Ryotsu Kankichi is up!
He crawled back up from the depths of hell!

323
00:21:43,140 --> 00:21:45,640
If it's come to this,
we're playing our last card.

324
00:21:48,420 --> 00:21:50,189
What! Ryotsu has detected it!

325
00:21:50,239 --> 00:21:52,720
He was wearing a cast under his hakama!

326
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:05,339
With only sweat pouring
from his steely body,

327
00:22:05,389 --> 00:22:08,340
shouting like a true Kameari caveman!

328
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:12,360
Shogi begins and ends with martial spirit!

329
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:13,573
Here I come!

330
00:22:13,623 --> 00:22:17,160
Vacuum Tornado Drop!
Dance of the Dragon God!

331
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:21,145
Not if I can help it!

332
00:22:21,195 --> 00:22:23,360
Vacuum Hinatsuna Drop!

333
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:27,280
Giant Whirlpool Version!

334
00:22:43,740 --> 00:22:44,400
What?!

335
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:58,280
Ooooh!

336
00:22:59,220 --> 00:23:01,880
The match is decided. Ryotsu Kankichi wins!

337
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,040
Ryo-san wins!

338
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,720
Sorry, Ryo-chan.

339
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:07,160
Senpai, you're the best in the world!

340
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:09,060
Aaaaah, the crowd!

341
00:23:09,780 --> 00:23:14,360
Yes! I've finally avenged
my years-long grudge!

342
00:23:15,300 --> 00:23:15,860
Me

343
00:23:23,340 --> 00:23:24,760
What is this...

344
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:28,680
...the battle ends with a shockwave!

345
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,380
Aaaaah!

346
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:38,140
Help me, I'm getting blown away!

347
00:23:38,700 --> 00:23:41,160
Enough with shogi, this is brutal!

348
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:08,020
Playing every day

349
00:24:08,820 --> 00:24:09,800
Hendy

350
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:13,940
Boredom? I crumpled it into
a reprimand and tossed it away.

351
00:24:15,020 --> 00:24:17,440
Bare instincts, naked desires.

352
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,500
Getting foolish,

353
00:24:19,360 --> 00:24:22,280
reckless and broke,
and that's fine, isn't it?

354
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,300
That's not it.

355
00:24:24,100 --> 00:24:26,620
My way, doing things however I want,

356
00:24:26,620 --> 00:24:28,040
that's all I'm going to do!

357
00:24:28,460 --> 00:24:28,700
Amazing!

358
00:24:28,700 --> 00:24:30,820
The stiff chief's thunderbolt.

359
00:24:31,500 --> 00:24:32,620
Smoke from the head.

360
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,620
Run away and you'll find a turtle (Kameari).

361
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:37,340
How wonderful, isn't it?

362
00:24:37,340 --> 00:24:38,260
Ohoo!

363
00:24:38,260 --> 00:24:39,860
In the flowery Edo,

364
00:24:39,860 --> 00:24:40,540
Hey there!

365
00:24:40,540 --> 00:24:41,840
Ryōzan taifū

366
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:42,960
Thanks as always!

367
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:44,060
Crazy!

368
00:24:44,980 --> 00:24:46,200
Atarakamo

369
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:46,600
Play!

370
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:47,240
Nine times

371
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:49,020
Ten games, ten games

372
00:24:49,020 --> 00:24:50,200
Out of water here

373
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,320
A big gap, like fish and water

374
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:52,760
Suigyo-matsu

375
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:53,660
Gungyo-matsu

376
00:24:53,660 --> 00:24:54,500
Fly pass

377
00:24:54,500 --> 00:24:55,760
Gooder tokoro ni

378
00:24:55,760 --> 00:24:56,400
Right over there

379
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:58,060
Yamura Koji

380
00:24:58,060 --> 00:24:58,780
Bura Koji

381
00:24:58,780 --> 00:24:59,680
Paipo paipo

382
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,220
Paipo no

383
00:25:00,220 --> 00:25:01,280
Shuringan

384
00:25:01,280 --> 00:25:02,200
Shuringan no

385
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,100
Kuringarai

386
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:04,300
Kuringarai no

387
00:25:04,300 --> 00:25:05,340
Ponpoko pii no

388
00:25:05,340 --> 00:25:06,260
Ponpoko Naado

389
00:25:15,140 --> 00:25:19,240
The Katsushika Precinct has developed a
machine that can easily carry any heavy object!

390
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:23,180
It's called the Super Power Assist Suit,
Otasukekun!

391
00:25:23,660 --> 00:25:25,660
Well, first I'll test it myself.

392
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:29,240
Hello, this is Ryo-san's
Zenigame Moving Service!

393
00:25:29,600 --> 00:25:32,080
Next time on Iron-Arm Ryo, see you!

394
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:35,840
Over there, it's Kame-ary!

395
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:38,960
Well, surely there's a turtle, Kame-ari!

396
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:44,220
Everyone, come on over to our town!

397
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:45,800
Thank you.

